{% comment %}
  ==================================================================
  VALUE PROPS
  Ported from gs-shopify-v3 sections/value-props.liquid
  ==================================================================
  The black trust bar under the hero on the homepage:
  "Over 11M Patriots Served / Veteran Operated / Officially Licensed"

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  LAYOUT BUG: FIXED 140px GAP WITH NO WRAPPING
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 set:
      .value-props-flex { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 140px; }
  with no flex-wrap. Three uppercase phrases plus 280px of fixed gap
  overflows horizontally on tablet and small-laptop widths - the
  content is centred, so it clips at BOTH ends rather than one.

  The mobile override only kicked in under 768px, leaving 768-1100px
  unhandled. Now uses flex-wrap plus a clamped gap that scales with
  the viewport, so it degrades instead of clipping.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  DEPRECATED MEDIA QUERY
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 used:
      @media screen and (max-device-width: 374px) and (min-device-width: 320px)
  device-width refers to the physical screen, not the viewport. It is
  deprecated, does not respond to resizing or zoom, and behaves
  unpredictably on modern devices. Replaced with a viewport max-width.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  HARDCODED VALUES MADE EDITABLE / TOKENISED
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  1. TEXT COLOUR was hardcoded #FFFFFF while the background was a
     merchant setting. Setting a light background produced invisible
     text with no way to fix it in the editor. Now a real setting,
     defaulting to white so current appearance is unchanged.

  2. FONT FAMILY was hardcoded to 'Roboto Condensed' with no fallback
     stack, bypassing the theme's font system entirely. Now uses
     --headingFont from the token bridge, which resolves to whatever
     the theme heading font is - currently Roboto Condensed.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  OTHER CHANGES
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  3. GLOBAL CSS LEAK. The <style> block declared .main-value-title,
     .value-props-flex and .value-props-container globally, once per
     section instance. Moved to an asset and namespaced.

  4. NO BLOCK LIMIT. A merchant could add unlimited values and break
     the row silently. Capped at 5, which the layout handles.

  5. SEMANTICS. Three sibling <p> tags became a list, which is what
     this is. Screen readers now announce it as a group of 3 items.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  PRESERVED
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  The block setting id is `customer_name` - clearly copy-pasted from a
  testimonials section, since these are value propositions and not
  customer names. The id is WRONG but it is what templates/index.json
  is bound to, so it stays. Renaming it is a tracked migration.
  ==================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'gs-value-props.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
  <div
    class="gs-value-props"
    style="
      --vp-bg: {{ section.settings.bg_color | default: '#000000' }};
      --vp-text: {{ section.settings.text_color | default: '#ffffff' }};
    "
  >
    <ul class="gs-value-props__list">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.settings.customer_name != blank -%}
          <li class="gs-value-props__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {{- block.settings.customer_name -}}
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Value props",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section gs-value-props-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Text color",
      "info": "Was hardcoded to white in v3.",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "value",
      "name": "Value",
      "limit": 5,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "customer_name",
          "label": "Value title",
          "info": "Setting id is customer_name for template compatibility.",
          "default": "Veteran Operated"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Value props",
      "blocks": [{ "type": "value" }, { "type": "value" }, { "type": "value" }]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
